{"id":"bb9a1d5e360bf758","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-general-second-incompleteness.md","title":"Second Incompleteness under an Arithmetic Interpretation","display":"thm-general-second-incompleteness — Second Incompleteness under an Arithmetic Interpretation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-general-second-incompleteness","aliases":["67-thm-general-second-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-general-second-incompleteness — Second Incompleteness under an Arithmetic Interpretation","depends_on":["[[67-df-general-relative-interpretation]]","[[67-df-general-consistency]]","[[67-df-PA]]","[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]","[[67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness]]","[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_scope":"第 8 章 §1，Theorem 3(a)，印刷页 120；PDF 第 131 页","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"原书陈述与短证明已读并核图；一般翻译的内部逻辑保持和本地一致性编码转换未补齐","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-general-second-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-general-second-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-general-second-incompleteness — Second Incompleteness under an Arithmetic Interpretation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"433a5a5e16d90414\" href=\"?note=433a5a5e16d90414\" title=\"67-df-general-relative-interpretation\">67-df-general-relative-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f76c99f69499336d\" href=\"?note=f76c99f69499336d\" title=\"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma\">67-thm-fixed-point-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6fca065df2bf5fac\" href=\"?note=6fca065df2bf5fac\" title=\"67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness\">67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 8 章 §1，Theorem 3(a)，印刷页 120；PDF 第 131 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"原书陈述与短证明已读并核图；一般翻译的内部逻辑保持和本地一致性编码转换未补齐"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 是有限有效一阶语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_K\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_K\\)</span> 是一致 PR 公理呈示，采用本册固定强编号和证明算术化。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>一般解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}\">\\(\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd_{L,K}\">\\(\\unlhd_{L,K}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"433a5a5e16d90414\" href=\"?note=433a5a5e16d90414\" title=\"67-df-general-relative-interpretation\">67-df-general-relative-interpretation</a>；一般语言的算术一致性句和代码有界公理片段取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a>。下标标出源、目标语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 的量化与公式编码均在元层。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}(\\mathrm{PA},T,t)\">\\(\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}(\\mathrm{PA},T,t)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^K_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^K_T\\)</span> 按前述标准呈示和证明算术化绑定；不能替换成任意在标准模型中正确的公式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>语法和证明参数固定为本册 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_K=c_K\">\\(g_K=c_K\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{K,T},D,\\gamma\">\\(e_{K,T},D,\\gamma\\)</span>；所有有限片段使用同一演算和该文件声明的程序图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a> 的同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_K\">\\(\\pi_K\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_K(\\pi_K)\">\\(\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_K(\\pi_K)\\)</span>；本条所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>-公理集及其有限片段的一致性句均由该系统绑定，因而包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdGPrf}\">\\(\\mathrm{StdGPrf}\\)</span> 的 PA 内桥接条件。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\nvdash t(\\mathrm{Con}^K_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\nvdash t(\\mathrm{Con}^K_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>源书只要求 PA 可解释于目标，不要求目标语言含算术运算，更不要求 PA 是目标公理集的字面子集。源证明取第8章 Theorem 1 的固定点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\neg\\varphi\\to\\mathrm{Pr}_T(t(\\varphi))\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\neg\\varphi\\to\\mathrm{Pr}_T(t(\\varphi))\\)</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 有限及第6章 Fact12，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\neg\\varphi\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\neg\\varphi\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_T\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash t(\\mathrm{Con}_T)\\to t(\\varphi)\">\\(T\\vdash t(\\mathrm{Con}_T)\\to t(\\varphi)\\)</span>。若目标证明前件，就违反第8章第一不完备性。</p>\n<p>上述是对书面论证的复核，尚未把跨语言 PR 翻译、内部证明保持和新一致性编码的转换逐式形式化，故状态不升级为已核验证明依赖。Theorem 3(b) 的任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 表示版本未在本条断言，避免把尚仅限算术公理代码的 numeration 接口直接泛化。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，原档案所引 PDF；第 8 章 §1，Theorem 3(a)，印刷页 120；PDF 第 131 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：原书陈述与短证明已读并核图；一般翻译的内部逻辑保持和本地一致性编码转换未补齐。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-general-relative-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"433a5a5e16d90414","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-general-relative-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-general-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"a4af62d1c1b0b08f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-general-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f76c99f69499336d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"6fca065df2bf5fac","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K$ 是有限有效一阶语言；$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_K$ 是一致 PR 公理呈示，采用本册固定强编号和证明算术化。$\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 取 [[67-df-PA]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-general-relative-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"433a5a5e16d90414","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"一般解释 $\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}$、$\\unlhd_{L,K}$ 取 [[67-df-general-relative-interpretation]]；一般语言的算术一致性句和代码有界公理片段取 [[67-df-general-consistency]]。下标标出源、目标语言；$\\vdash$ 的量化与公式编码均在元层。","embed":false